## Overview

A structured AI skill for generating modular Elysia backend architectures — routes, plugins, services, and typed handlers — following consistent patterns across projects.

## Features

- Scaffolds modular Elysia project structures
- Generates typed route handlers and plugins
- Enforces consistent backend conventions
